# Vendored agent skills. The Neon skills this platform is built on are
# committed — they document the primitives the coding agent generates against
# and are bundled into the agent at build time (see packages/skills). Refresh
# with the `skills:sync` script. Anything else stays local.
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/neon
!.agents/skills/neon-postgres
!.agents/skills/neon-ai-gateway
!.agents/skills/neon-functions
!.agents/skills/neon-object-storage
!.agents/skills/neon-postgres-agent-platforms
